    "recordedTerminalOutcomeIsA": "CONTROL_PLANE_ARTIFACT_OF_THE_F0X_PROGRESSION_DEFECT",
    "statement": "The preserved study-terminal.json records COMPLETED_ALL_SLOTS with slotsCompleted 10, and each of the ten study-events/*-SLOT_COMPLETED_CLASS_C.json records a Class C completion. Neither establishes any successful or empirical replicate. Every one of the ten children refused at its own freeze stage (ENOENT on the relative historical freeze path, providerConstructed false); zero provider requests, zero adapter attempts, zero classifier results, zero repairs, no scoring and no HOLDOUT access occurred. Under the frozen F0V inclusion rule every slot is CLASS_B_AUTHORISATION_CONSUMED_CONFIRMED_PRE_INFERENCE_REFUSAL: its candidate is spent, no semantic replicate exists, and it counts zero toward N=5. The historical records are not rewritten; this erratum supersedes their interpretation only.",
    "rootCauses": [
      {
        "id": "DEFECT_1_RELATIVE_CHILD_FREEZE_PATH",
        "summary": "studyExecutor.ts passed buildSlotExecutionPlanTemplate()'s relative historical freeze path into runExperiment; the Tier-2 harness forks each child with its scratch directory as cwd and childMain.ts reads manifest.freezePath verbatim, so every child failed with ENOENT at stage freeze. cliF0O.ts had absolutised with join(RUNNER_REPO_ROOT, F0O_FREEZE_PATH)."
      },
      {
        "id": "DEFECT_2_STOPPED_EXPERIMENT_ADVANCED_AS_CLASS_C",
        "summary": "studyExecutor.ts labelled any returned runExperiment() result, STOPPED included, SLOT_COMPLETED_CLASS_C and advanced; f0w/sequencing.ts read child-manifest/child-preflight/final-record/stop-decision/tier2-outcome as SEMANTIC_EXECUTION_OBSERVED, so the next slot's sequencing gate also admitted it."
      }
    ],
